OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of mums have undiagnosed
OL,4,APTSD, study says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of women in the UK may be
OL,7,Fsuffering from undiagnosed
OL,8,Fpost-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD)
OL,9,Fafter giving birth, a study has found.
OL,11,FLead researcher and GP Dr Megan Foreman
OL,12,Fsaid the University of East Anglia
OL,13,F(UEA) report showed one in 20 new
OL,14,Fmothers developed PTSD.
OL,16,FWomen can suffer from the disorder
OL,17,Fafter a difficult pregnancy or birth
OL,18,Fand symptoms include flashbacks,
OL,19,Fnightmares, anxiety and persistent
OL,20,Ftroubling thoughts.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
